<h1>3. System Architecture &amp; Modular Decomposition</h1>
<h2>3.1 Module Descriptions</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Module 1: Top Navigation &amp; Visitor Engine:</strong> Fixed-top glassmorphism navbar featuring brand identity, active state hover transitions, wishlist offcanvas counter, instant PKR booking shortcut, and a live visitor count badge.</li>
  <li><strong>Module 2: Cinematic Beach Video Hero:</strong> Full-width ambient HTML5 video loop showcasing crystal ocean surf, with high-contrast dual-line typography, Playfair Display 800 styling, and responsive call-to-action controls.</li>
  <li><strong>Module 3: Zone Categorization Hub (West, North, East, South):</strong> Geocoded destination cards equipped with PKR package rates, verified star ratings, badges, and quick-filter button controls.</li>
  <li><strong>Module 4: Luxury Quick View &amp; Document Exporters:</strong> Accessible Bootstrap modal featuring water temperature metrics, optimal season, crowd density ratings, insider advice, and instant client-side PDF/DOC generation.</li>
  <li><strong>Module 5: 4K Drone Photography Lightbox:</strong> Interactive photo gallery with categorized filters and touch-enabled fullscreen lightbox supporting image carousel navigation.</li>
  <li><strong>Module 6: Transit Advertising &amp; Logistics:</strong> Executive coastal highway coach lines, chartered island seaplanes, and 4WD expedition fleets for seamless arrival.</li>
  <li><strong>Module 7: Continuous Scrolling Telemetry Ticker:</strong> Bottom fixed marquee rendering live local date, real-time PKT seconds clock, and asynchronous HTML5 Geolocation coordinates with automated fallback.</li>
  <li><strong>Module 8: Interactive Concierge Modals:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><em>Viewer Feedback Modal:</em> 5-star interactive rating form with reviewer name, destination selector, comments, and localStorage persistence.</li>
      <li><em>Traveler Queries Modal:</em> Accordion FAQ addressing transit, rates, and safety, coupled with a direct dispatch inquiry form.</li>
      <li><em>Site Map Modal:</em> Comprehensive architectural hierarchy illustrating core portals, 4 zones, and utilities.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Module 9: 256-Bit SSL Escrow Gateway:</strong> Multi-method Pakistani Rupee payment engine calculating base packages, passenger multiples, taxes, and issuing downloadable PDF booking receipts.</li>
</ul>

